<title>JAPAN: Sony unit to boost monthly PlayStation output.</title>
<headline>Sony unit to boost monthly PlayStation output.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sony Computer Entertainment Inc, a unit of Sony Corp, said on Friday that it would boost monthly production of its PlayStation game machine to 1.5 million units in May from the current one million.</p>
</text>
